{"id":"STev_02_06","names":{"Mischievous Boy":"Mischievous Boy","Rowdy Kids":"Rowdy Kids","avg1_150":"Laru","avg1_158":"Laru","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_168":"Chica","avg3_170":"Chico del Distrito de las Cenizas","avg3_200":"Ash District Boy","avg4_101":"Little Laru Bright Ver"},"en":{"Mischievous Boy":"Mischievous Boy","Rowdy Kids":"Rowdy Kids","avg1_150":"Laru","avg1_158":"Laru","avg3_100":"Sylar","avg3_168":"Generic Girl B","avg3_170":"Generic Ash District Boy","avg3_200":"Ash District Boy","avg4_101":"Little Laru Bright Ver"},"tx":1,"steps":[["intro","Act Six","A Wish in Loneliness","Laru confesses that the person in the photo is herself. She talks about how she was shunned by her peers when she was little because she couldn't control her light magic, as well as the existence of the true Spirit."],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","city_alley_daylight_winter",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["bgm","m53"],["show","avg1_158","a","003",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_158","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Ah...==W== Tyrant, you're so mean...==W== You already knew, didn't you? You just wanted to mess with me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","008","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["w",1.0],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_101"],["ctl","avg1_158","a","004",null,null,-0.18,1.2,null,"chijing","OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_158","That so-called \"Snowish Tree Spirit\" in the photo ...==W== is me.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","008","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"q","012","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","Of course I knew.==W== One look at the photo and it's obvious.",1,""],["w",1.3],["mrt",0,"q","021",null,"lengzhan"],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"q","014",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","And when you think about it, it all makes sense. You usually dodge work whenever you can, yet you were so eager to find that photo.==W== And you tried to avoid talking about the Spirit whenever the topic came up...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"q","019",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"q",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","013","flurry",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Alright, alright, stop with the analysis! Yes, I'm the Spirit in the photo! I admit it!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","I was planning to grab the photo before you saw it. Then I'd either hide it or toss it out...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","But when I saw how happy the kids were talking about it, I guess...==W== Better to just let it be.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["se","se_101"],["ctl","avg1_158","a","013",null,0.45,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Besides, I was thinking...==W== What if...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a",null,"flurry",null,null,null,null,"youchupeng","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"q","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","What if—?",1,""],["mrt",3,"q",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","014","resentful",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg1_158","N-never mind! I just didn't want you to see it, okay?!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","005",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["mrt",1,"q","015",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Why's that?",1,""],["mrt",3,"q",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_101"],["ctl","avg1_158","a","005",null,0.5,null,null,null,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Because it's from when I was a kid!==W== Ugh, it's so, so embarrassing!",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","013","shy",null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"q","002",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Embarrassing? I actually think you looked really cute.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"q","013",null,"diantou"],["say","avg3_100","The soft glow around you gave it an air of mystery.==W== No wonder the kids thought you were the spirit.",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"q","015",null,null],["goon"],["mrt",3,"q",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bg","mood_4",0,0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","010","awkward",null,null,null,null,"chijing","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","W-Well...==W== To tell the truth, I really was glowing...",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["bg","city_alley_daylight_winter",0,0.5],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"q","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Huh? Wait, you mean that wasn't lighting?",1,""],["mrt",3,"q",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","008",null,0.5,null,null,null,"ChanDou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Ah! Fine. Since you've already seen it,==W== I might as well explain before you get the wrong idea.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a",null,"sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","When I was little, all the kids on my street were into fishing.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",2,"q","021","sweaty",null],["say","avg3_100","What's with this fishing talk again?",1,""],["mrt",4,"q",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_158","a","005","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_158","Boss! Would you just let me finish?",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"q","003",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Right...==W== Go ahead, please...",1,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",0,"q","002",nul